{"id":"skala","lemma":"скала","pos":"noun","rank":4999,"glosses":["rock, cliff, crag (mass of projecting rock)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/ff/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"скалы","plural":"скалы"},"examples":[{"text":"Его сын упал со скалы.","en":"His son fell over the cliff.","words":[{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"son"},{"g":"to fall, to drop","l":"упасть"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Скала почти отвесная.","en":"The cliff is almost vertical.","words":[null,{"g":"almost, nearly"},null]},{"text":"Том прыгнул со скалы.","en":"Tom jumped off the cliff.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to jump","l":"прыгнуть"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Скала нависает над морем.","en":"The cliff hangs over the sea.","words":[null,null,{"g":"above, over"},null]},{"text":"Корабль разбился о скалы.","en":"The ship crashed on the rocks.","words":[{"g":"ship, liner"},null,{"g":"about"},null]}]}